{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-130-1","title":"Psalms 130:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The psalmist professes his hope in prayer; 5 and his patience in hope. 7 He exhorts Israel to trust in God.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir. 3464. B.C. cir. 540. (Title.) A Song. 121:1; 122:1; 123:1; 124:1; 125:1; 126:1; 127:1; 128:1; *titles 129:1; *titles Out of. 18:4-6,16; 25:16-18; 40:2; 42:7; 69:1,2,14,15; 71:20; 88:6,7 116:3,4; La 3:53-55; Jon 2:2-4; Heb 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-2","title":"Psalms 130:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>let thine ears. 5:1,2; 17:1; 55:1,2; 61:1,2; 2Ch 6:40; Ne 1:6,11; Isa 37:17 Da 9:17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-3","title":"Psalms 130:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>shouldest mark. 143:2; Job 9:2,3,20; 10:14; 15:14; Isa 53:6; Joh 8:7-9; Ro 3:20-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-4","title":"Psalms 130:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>But there. 25:11; 86:5; 103:2,3; Ex 34:5-7; Isa 1:18; 55:7; Jer 31:34; Da 9:9 Mic 7:18-20; Ro 8:1; 2Co 5:19; Eph 1:7; Col 1:14 that thou mayest. 2:11,12; 1Ki 8:39,40; Jer 33:8,9; Ho 3:5; Ac 9:31; 2Ti 2:19 Heb 12:24-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-5","title":"Psalms 130:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I wait. 27:14; 33:20; 40:1; 62:1,5; Ge 49:18; Isa 8:17; 26:8; 30:18 Lu 2:25,38 and in his. 119:42,49,81,114; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-6","title":"Psalms 130:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>waiteth. 63:6; 119:147; Ac 27:29 I say more than they that watch for the morning. or, whichwatch unto the morning. 134:1; Isa 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-7","title":"Psalms 130:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Let Israel. 40:3; 71:5; 115:9-13; 131:1,3; Zep 3:12 for with. 4; 86:5,15; Isa 55:7; Ro 5:20,21; 8:24; Eph 1:7,8; 1Ti 2:5,6 Heb 10:35; 1Jo 2:1,2; Re 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-130-8","title":"Psalms 130:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":130,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":130,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he shall redeem. 103:3,4; Mt 1:21; Ro 6:14; Tit 2:14; 1Jo 3:5-8</p>"}]}